  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nExpression: √400 + √0.0121 − √7.84\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nSquare root: √a² = a\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ √400 = 20\n\n⇒ √0.0121 = 0.11\n\n⇒ √7.84 = 2.8\n\n⇒ 20 + 0.11 − 2.8\n\n⇒ 20.11 − 2.8 = 17.31\n\n**∴ The value is 17.31.**",
